# pioarduino from-source framework build artifacts.
# Triggered by `custom_sdkconfig` (CONFIG_SPIRAM=n) in platformio.ini, which is
# the authoritative, version-controlled source of the override. These are all
# regenerated from it on each build ("DO NOT EDIT" auto-generated dumps), so they
# are cruft, not inputs. See debug/sticks3-bootloop.
.dummy/
managed_components/
sdkconfig
sdkconfig.*
